## Vulnerability Description
The ping() method in arpping is vulnerable to command injection via unsafe shell command construction using child_process.exec() with concatenated inputs, allowing an attacker to execute arbitrary system commands through crafted IP addresses or flag arguments.

## Vulnerable API
Arpping.prototype.ping

