Run with the backtrack limit flag enabled to make the failure explicit:
```bash
node --regexp-backtracks-before-fallback=30000 exploit.js
```
The script will visibly hang, throw a regex backtracking error, or consume disproportionate CPU cycles until the engine aborts, proving the exponential behavior caused by unsanitized input.

